mission "A Signal at Pelican Point"
    name "A Signal at Pelican Point"
    description "Break the two launches at Pelican Point, then sail to Pelican's Rest and escort the paymaster ashore."
    source "Port Azure"
    destination "Pelican's Rest"
    reward 620
    objective kills 2
    battlefield "Pelican Point" 7150 2250
    enemy "Pelican Point Guard 1"
    enemy "Pelican Point Guard 2"
    speaker offer "Harbourmaster"
    speaker visit "Harbourmaster"
    speaker complete "Harbourmaster"
    to offer
        has "The Pilot's Ledger: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `A fishing family has lit a distress beacon at Pelican Point. Company men are searching their village for a missing tariff book.`
            `The family hid a Company paymaster who deserted after learning that the firm planned to seize the Windward harbours by force.`
            `Two armed launches are circling the point. The family cannot leave until the launches are driven away.`
            choice
                `(I will take this voyage. Tell me the course.)`
                    goto accept_job
                `(What makes this business so important?)`
                    goto more_details
                `(I have other waters to sail.)`
                    goto decline_job
            label more_details
                `Two armed launches are circling the point. The family cannot leave until the launches are driven away.`
                choice
                    `(Then I will see it done.)`
                        goto accept_job
                    `(Not this time.)`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Elian gives you a copy of the decoded ledger. “If Ashcombe is building a navy, he will need men, powder, and safe anchorages.”`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `The officer nods and rolls the chart closed. The offer will remain here if you change your mind.`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted A Signal at Pelican Point. Break the two launches at Pelican Point, then sail to Pelican's Rest and escort the paymaster ashore."
    on visit
        conversation
            `The family reaches the harbour with the deserter. He names the next Company supply depot at Blackwater Reach and offers to testify.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `The paymaster confirms that Company ships carry sealed orders from a governor far to the south.`
        log "Completed A Signal at Pelican Point. Received 620 gold. The paymaster confirms that Company ships carry sealed orders from a governor far to the south."
